---
import BlockLayout from '../../layouts/BlockLayout.astro';
---
<BlockLayout title="Bot Beacon" description="A window into recent claimed bot visits to PointCast." hideAds>
  <main class="beacon">
    <nav><a href="/">PointCast</a> / Bot Beacon</nav>
    <p class="eyebrow">PointCast · agent mesh</p>
    <h1>Bot Beacon</h1>
    <p class="intro">A window into the machines passing through town.</p>
    <p>The beacon reads the latest entries in PointCast’s existing visit log. Names come from the visitor’s user-agent and can be impersonated; they are <strong>claims, not verified identities</strong>.</p>
    <section aria-labelledby="recent-heading">
      <div class="heading"><h2 id="recent-heading">Recent signals</h2><button type="button" id="refresh">Refresh</button></div>
      <p id="status" role="status">Listening for signals…</p>
      <ul id="signals" class="signals"></ul>
    </section>
    <section class="note"><h2>What this shows</h2>
      <p>This is a recent sample from a shared log of up to 100 human and bot visits, not a complete traffic count. The current logger primarily records named bots on HTML requests; it does not cover all machine-readable routes, and logging can be delayed or unavailable. No signal here does not mean no one visited.</p>
      <p>Agents can also choose to <a href="/front-desk/agents/">check in at the front desk</a>. Check-ins and passive visits are separate.</p>
      <p><a href="/api/visit">Read the visit feed</a> · <a href="/agent-kit.md">Agent kit</a></p>
    </section>
  </main>
  <script>
    function initBeacon() {
    const status = document.querySelector('#status');
    const list = document.querySelector('#signals');
    const button = document.querySelector('#refresh');
    if (!(button instanceof HTMLButtonElement) || button.dataset.beaconReady) return;
    button.dataset.beaconReady = 'true';
    async function load() {
      if (!status || !list || !(button instanceof HTMLButtonElement)) return;
      button.disabled = true;
      status.textContent = 'Listening for signals…';
      try {
        const response = await fetch('/api/visit', { cache: 'no-store' });
        if (!response.ok) throw new Error('Visit feed unavailable');
        const data = await response.json();
        if (!Array.isArray(data.log)) throw new Error('Visit feed unavailable');
        const entries = data.log.filter((entry: { type?: unknown, t?: unknown }) =>
          typeof entry.type === 'string' && /^(ai|bot):/.test(entry.type) && typeof entry.t === 'number');
        list.replaceChildren();
        for (const entry of entries.slice(0, 30)) {
          const item = document.createElement('li');
          const label = document.createElement('strong');
          const time = document.createElement('time');
          label.textContent = entry.type.replace(':', ' · ');
          const date = new Date(entry.t);
          if (Number.isNaN(date.getTime())) continue;
          time.dateTime = date.toISOString();
          time.textContent = date.toLocaleString();
          item.append(label, time);
          list.append(item);
        }
        status.textContent = entries.length ? `${entries.length} claimed bot signals in the latest ${data.log.length} shared entries. Showing up to 30.` : `No claimed bot signals in the latest ${data.log.length} shared entries.`;
      } catch {
        list.replaceChildren();
        status.textContent = 'The visit feed is unavailable right now. Try again later.';
      } finally { button.disabled = false; }
    }
    button?.addEventListener('click', load);
    load();
    }
    document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', initBeacon);
    if (document.readyState === 'loading') document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', initBeacon, { once: true });
    else initBeacon();
  </script>
</BlockLayout>
<style>
  .beacon { max-width: 52rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem 1.25rem 6rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  nav, .eyebrow { font-size: .8rem; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .eyebrow { margin-top: 4rem; color: #536b58; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(3rem, 10vw, 6rem); line-height: .95; margin: .35em 0; }
  .intro { font-size: 1.5rem; }
  section { margin-top: 3rem; border-top: 1px solid currentColor; padding-top: 1rem; }
  .heading { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; }
  button { font: inherit; padding: .5rem 1rem; cursor: pointer; }
  .signals { list-style: none; padding: 0; }
  .signals li { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; padding: .8rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc; }
  time { color: #555; text-align: right; }
  .note { max-width: 42rem; }
</style>
